  "comment": "kiln.ui.values (dev.28, package 05a-value-providers): the game's own UI values on the client, client build 26430625, static analysis (docs/re and the 05a chapter). DetailBarDraw / SlotBarDraw: mids before the bar draw call (rcx = the temporary Bar descriptor: +0 fraction f32, +4/+8 current/max u32, +0x38 GameText label; detail rdi = thumbnail descriptor whose +detail.view points to ItemDetail's own copied record, slot rbx = ItemView). PlayerUiUpdate: void(iterator) that copies the iterated entity's values into the play data (+play.localEntity the entity, u32 pairs health/stamina/mana/held fuel, inventory models at +play.models / +play.modelsCount of stride model.stride, each with +model.owner and item views at +model.views / +model.viewsCount of stride view.stride); PlayerUiPlayCapture: mid before the health store, rsi = play; HeldItemCapture: mid before testing the held NetworkFuel, rsi = play, edi = held pide, rbx = fuel or null (first instruction test rbx,rbx; je rel8). HudStatus: the HUD's reader of the pairs (not hooked; a guard that the reader is as analyzed). ItemDetail / DetailLinesAppend: the detail view and its content merge point (context collection only, no native line is drawn). ItemSlot returns the 0x20-byte slot record (xywh, state bytes) through hidden storage; SlotGeometry is after the inner bounds query (rax -> xywh, r15 = descriptor). FuelToCharges captures WaterChargeAmount and the balancing offsets (units per charge). ui/UiApp, ui/ui.data, ui/state.play, ui/GameUiFrame and ui/sys.* are ui.json's. Every feature is client-gated (game test pending) until the dev.28 client pass.",
